workersUnionActivitiesBullets:
Participating in the development of regulatory documents concerning the protection of the rights and interests of trade union members;
Conducting public oversight of labour legislation;
Negotiating collective agreements and resolving disputes in employment relations;
Strengthening the social protection of members;
Organising cultural and educational events;
Promoting the health, physical fitness and sport for KUQ members and their families;
Establishing cooperation with social and non-governmental organisations, and foreign trade unions.
